WEBVTT

NOTE Captions timed proportionally by sentence; full transcript follows in lesson.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.933
This is a fictional weekly service record.

00:00:02.933 --> 00:00:04.190
Forty-two requests arrived.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:05.865
Thirty-six were marked resolved.

00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:13.407
Before you ask AI to draft a report, notice exactly what the record does and does not say.

00:00:13.407 --> 00:00:15.083
It gives us counts.

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:19.691
It does not give us completion times or last week's results.

00:00:19.691 --> 00:00:21.786
Keep those gaps in view.
